== Quest Start ==
Talk to Torgon Blademaster in the [[Plane of Sky]].

You say, 'Hail, Torgon Blademaster'
:''Torgon Blademaster says, 'Greetings, Tify. Are you a [true warrior]?' ''
You say, 'true warrior'
:''Torgon Blademaster says, 'Then you shall be tested as one.  Of the many tests I have prepared, choose.  If you think yourself ready, dare you take the test of [strength], [force], or perhaps [skill]?  Maybe you're a more simple creature, and would prefer the tests of [bash], [smash], and [think]?' ''

== Warrior Test of Strength ==

You say, 'strength'
:''Torgon Blademaster says, 'Remember, true strength lies not only in the body, but in the mind as well. Return to me a stone amulet and a wind rune azia.  If you manage to do this, my runed wind amulet shall be yours.' ''

'''Reward:''' {{:Runed Wind Amulet}}

